00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.470
[? We want ?] to cover
starting with what

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:36.010
is persistent disk, a quick
introduction, a quick detail

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:39.110
around one of the feature sets
